ick 271. No shelter has been established. Actual execution must recheck local conditions, access, material identities and geometry. Do not ingest unfamiliar resources or assume that a tree canopy is shelter.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":\\\"Currently owned inventory lists two branches and 0.9 vine. Their suitability for protection is unknown. Use only accessible real supports and owned materials with explicit allocation; any additional material must be identified and acquired separately.\\\",\\\"costs\\\":\\\"Method, work duration and energy requirements are unknown. Specify costs before construction, preserve paid partial progress and material accounting, and provide a cancellation and recovery contract.\\\",\\\"effects\\\":\\\"Enable actual examination and, only if supported, a small reversible placement trial with subsequent observation of contact, exposure or protection. Do not award comfort, happiness, weather resistance or a shelter merely for requesting, studying or labeling the trial. Distinguish observed protection from unresolved effectiveness.\\\"}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"self.energy\\\",\\\"comparison\\\":\\\"gte\\\",\\\"value\\\":15}}],\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"interrupts\\\":[],\\\"notes\\\":[\\\"Tick 271 observation establishes mature marsh tubers with stock 18, not edibility or preparation requirements; leave them unconsumed.\\\",\\\"Meadow roots have supplied nutrition in prior meals; forest-root-1 currently shows seven available.\\\",\\\"Review the returned protection interface before learning or attempting any construction.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"outdoor-rest-protection\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can a small, reversible physical arrangement improve resting exposure using actually available materials?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"At tick 271 Lin is outdoors with rain 0.255 and wind about 0.415.\\\",\\\"Owned inventory lists two branches 